# Package Replacement Guide

Some components built by the initial scaffolding have premium replacements installed.
Use the PREMIUM version. The basic version stays for backwards compatibility but should
be phased out in new code.

## Replaced Components

| Basic (avoid in new code) | Premium (use this instead) | Why |
|---|---|---|
| `Counter` from `@repo/animation` | `NumberTicker` from `@/components/ui/number-ticker` | Magic UI's slot-machine style animation is far more visually impressive than a basic spring counter |
| `useScrollAnimation` from `@repo/animation` | `useInView` from `motion/react` | Motion's built-in hook does the same thing; no need for a custom IntersectionObserver wrapper |
| Hand-rolled scroll fade-ups (for major sections) | GSAP `ScrollTrigger` | GSAP can pin, parallax, and sequence — way beyond simple fade-up. Use `@repo/animation` FadeIn for small elements, GSAP for big section reveals |

