## What Still Works from @repo/animation (KEEP)

These are solid and complement the premium components:

- `FadeIn`, `AnimateOnScroll` — Good for small element reveals (cards, text blocks)
- `WordReveal` — Nice word-by-word text animation (pairs well with Aceternity's TextGenerateEffect for different contexts)
- `StaggerChildren` / `StaggerItem` — Useful for list/grid stagger patterns
- `useMagneticCursor` — Unique hover effect, no premium replacement needed
- `useReducedMotion` — Accessibility hook, always use this
- All variants in `variants.ts` — Clean motion presets, reuse freely

## Aceternity UI (copy-paste, no npm package)

These are NOT installed via npm. Copy the source from ui.aceternity.com when you need them:
- Aurora Background
- Background Beams
- Spotlight
- Text Generate Effect
- Typewriter Effect
- Lamp Effect
- 3D Card Effect
- Moving Border

Place copied Aceternity components in: `apps/web/components/aceternity/`
